  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "S001",
      "page": 1,
      "type": "note",
      "order": 1,
      "original_text": "",
      "english_paraphrase": "The paper studies Bayesian inverse problems with a learned diffusion prior and argues that tightly coupled denoising steps can fail on nonlinear measurements.",
      "translation": "论文研究带学习型扩散先验的贝叶斯逆问题，并指出连续紧耦合的去噪步骤在非线性观测下可能失败。",
      "source_kind": "paper-grounded-paraphrase",
      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
      "id": "S002",
      "page": 3,
      "type": "note",
      "order": 2,
      "original_text": "",
      "english_paraphrase": "Small reverse-diffusion steps keep consecutive samples close, so a wrong early mode can be corrected only locally.",
      "translation": "反向扩散的小步更新使相邻样本很接近，因此早期选错的模态只能被局部修正，难以跨越到另一个全局解。",
      "source_kind": "paper-grounded-paraphrase",
      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
      "id": "S003",
      "page": 3,
      "type": "note",
      "order": 3,
      "original_text": "",
      "english_paraphrase": "DAPS samples a measurement-conditioned time marginal at each noise level instead of forcing a Markov-like small step from the preceding sample.",
      "translation": "DAPS 在每个噪声水平直接近似采样受观测条件约束的时间边缘分布，而不是强迫从前一步做很小的马尔可夫式移动。",
      "source_kind": "paper-grounded-paraphrase",
      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
      "id": "S004",
      "page": 3,
      "type": "note",
      "order": 4,
      "original_text": "",
      "english_paraphrase": "The conditional clean sample is approximated with a prior term and a measurement likelihood term, then Langevin dynamics explores this unnormalized posterior.",
      "translation": "先用先验项和观测似然项构造干净样本的条件分布，再用 Langevin 动力学在这个未归一化后验中探索。",
      "source_kind": "paper-grounded-paraphrase",
      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
      "id": "S005",
      "page": 3,
      "type": "note",
      "order": 5,
      "original_text": "",
      "english_paraphrase": "A Gaussian approximation is cheaper than repeatedly evaluating the diffusion score, with a reported 6–7x speed advantage and a small task-dependent quality drop.",
      "translation": "高斯近似比反复调用扩散 score 便宜；作者报告其速度约快 6–7 倍，但质量有依任务而定的小幅下降。",
      "source_kind": "paper-grounded-paraphrase",
      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
      "id": "S006",
      "page": 4,
      "type": "note",
      "order": 6,
      "original_text": "",
      "english_paraphrase": "On FFHQ, DAPS reports 30.72 dB PSNR for phase retrieval and 27.12 dB for HDR, and the paper reports 31.49 dB for a high-resolution latent experiment.",
      "translation": "在 FFHQ 上，DAPS 报告 phase retrieval 的 PSNR 为 30.72 dB、HDR 为 27.12 dB；高分辨率 latent 实验报告 31.49 dB。",
      "source_kind": "paper-grounded-paraphrase",
      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
      "id": "S007",
      "page": 5,
      "type": "note",
      "order": 7,
      "original_text": "",
      "english_paraphrase": "DAPS produces diverse samples for sparse measurements, but a posterior sample is only a plausible explanation under the prior and measurement model.",
      "translation": "对信息稀疏的观测，DAPS 可以产生多样样本；但后验样本只是满足先验和观测模型的合理解释。",
      "source_kind": "paper-grounded-paraphrase",
      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
      "id": "S008",
      "page": 5,
      "type": "note",
      "order": 8,
      "original_text": "",
      "english_paraphrase": "The contribution is a decoupled posterior-sampling path for nonlinear inverse problems; it depends on a usable forward operator and a prior that covers the target distribution.",
      "translation": "贡献是为非线性逆问题提供解耦的后验采样路径；它依赖可用的前向算子以及覆盖目标分布的先验。",
      "source_kind": "paper-grounded-paraphrase",
      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
